      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINSOME WANDA (8) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (21.07) at this track in a Grade 4/5. Better than latest and can atone here. TOMMY'S HITMAN (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish a nose away in second (19.77) behind Chinese Chariot at Bulli. Expected to be in this for a long way. CHEEKY CHEESE (7) hit the ground running and was prominent throughout but faded out of it when 6th at Bulli in a Mix 3/4. One of the better chances. MOTHER GOOSE (6) has strong claims after a top-three finish at this track and distance last time out.",
